    "catalogue_tags": [],
    "catalogue_description": "About This map is a remake from an original map that goes by the same name, \u201cCourtyard\u201d. The map is from a unity webplayer game known as \u201cBeGone\u201d. This map includes a buyable ending along with BO1, MW1 and MW2 weapons along with some weapon sound effects from the original webplayer game. The original webplayer game had playermodels that seemed heavily inspired from MW2\u2019s characters Ramirez and Simon Ghost Riley so I decided to port those models as playermodels in this map. Recommendations Set your textures to high or above for the best texture visuals before launching the mod Weapons Included WAW Weapons \u2013 Thompson \u2013 MP40 \u2013 FG42 \u2013 PPSH \u2013 M1 Garand \u2013 MG42 \u2013 SW 357 Revolver \u2013 Trench Shotgun BO1 Weapons \u2013 M1911 \u2013 Commando \u2013 RPK \u2013 Spas 12 MW1 Weapons \u2013 M249 Saw \u2013 Benneli M1014 Shotgun MW3 Weapons \u2013 MP5 \u2013 MP7 \u2013 M4A1 Wonder Weapons ( Spoiler )",
